  "title": "Reader shortcodes: core and Jetpack shortcodes the site runs, with Shortcode Embeds on",
  "URL": "https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-shortcodes-core-and-jetpack-shortcodes-the-site-runs-with-shortcode-embeds-on/",
  "content": "<p>The site runs these shortcodes itself, before Jetpack Sync sends the post to WordPress.com.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_143\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-143\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-143\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A test image\" width=\"300\" height=\"163\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-143\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">A caption on a test image</figcaption></figure>\n<p>An audio shortcode with its URL first, which WordPress doesn’t run:</p>\n\n<p>An audio shortcode with a <code>src</code>:</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-175-2\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3?_=2\"><a href=\"https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3\">https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3</a></audio>\n<p>A SoundCloud track:</p>\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F293&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;visual=true&amp;show_comments=true&amp;color=false&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>\n<p>A tweet:</p>\n<div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"500\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">just setting up my twttr</p>— jack (@jack) <a href=\"https://x.com/jack/status/20?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">March 21, 2006</a></blockquote></div>\n<p>A YouTube video:</p>\n<iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jNQXAC9IVRw?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en-US&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>\n<p>Code, from the SyntaxHighlighter plugin:</p>\n<p>[code lang=”sql”]SELECT 1;[/code]</p>\n<p>The end.</p>",
  "excerpt": "The site runs these shortcodes itself, before Jetpack Sync sends the post to WordPress.com. An audio shortcode with its URL first, which WordPress doesn’t run: An audio shortcode with a src: A SoundCloud track: A tweet: A YouTube video: Code, from the SyntaxHighlighter plugin: [code lang=”sql”]SELECT 1;[/code] The end.",
